0089:     - Each gray bar 4-touches exactly one orange rectangle; some orange rectangles have no touching gray bar.
0090:     - Gray bars touching the same orange rectangle all have the same orientation.
0091: 
0092:     Rule
0093:     - Recolor every original gray cell to yellow.
0094:     - For each orange rectangle touched by gray bars, count the gray cells assigned to that rectangle.
0095:     - Horizontal gray bars repaint that many cells as complete orange rows starting from the contacted top or bottom row.
0096:     - Vertical gray bars repaint that many cells as complete orange columns starting from the contacted left or right column.
0097:     - Orange rectangles with no touching gray bar remain unchanged.
0098: 
0099:     Key insight
0100:     - The gray pixels are not copied by shape; their count is transferred into the neighboring orange rectangle as edge-aligned row or column stripes.
0101:     """
0102:     g = np.asarray(grid, dtype=int)
